    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T08:54:50Z",
    "body": "I put up https://github.com/whatwg/infra/pull/687 just as a first pass to have something concrete to talk about. Not sure how much detail or advice is desirable (e.g. around \"failure\" as per the discussion in #545), nor am I sure about the name.\n\nRegarding comparison, it seemed most straightforward to rely on equality comparisons through \"is\", rather than asking for \"ASCII case-insensitive\" comparisons. It seems inconsistent with existing usage to do anything beyond \"is\", but if there are good reasons to do so, we can consider it.",
